5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2ZElgZwbko0Q7kNvwG7IFWq&_nc_oc=Adqp2inCBV7HoqUasi5pKfTdde1uXt_6SILJ0oqdSGkN_UHQBqNle8HGHa_zOIKQps4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIe3r1HL-uzUv3VAfsuOoxPX4a0pAVj5TZ2zWn83a8DGg&oe=6AA3FDB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rqnIliii06gQ7kNvwFL1tQ7&_nc_oc=Adq279iFQ8tea492sPQTID75O4KQQAoPr4zu4f0zybv5sxwP4DJoy-ex8JLsQsr2Ph0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLv0sf3VvF3flfbn9D-XYDZ4jbgeEp3kzAy6tnCfxgmfA&oe=6AA41093"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uO8tZp6Kkm0Q7kNvwF2Tz6t&_nc_oc=Adq_s9roW4ekW4IVgVgX2V9mcHyxpwrtzg-cv6t7YSkJXNOC86p-NXBGnMSfaO-z9EQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLWhvC0MU8p-JO8YSdWabos5l8CbRjaR7LtXF10yHlR4Q&oe=6AA40EDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u